('c5a',N,"So here's one thing to try... today.","So here's one thing to try... today."),
('c5b',N,"Think of one person you'd call a rival. At work, at school, online.","Think of one person you'd call a rival. At work, at school, online."),
('c5c',N,"Take a piece of paper. On the left, write what they could really do to you. Be honest, not hopeful. That's Machiavelli.","Take a piece of paper. On the left, write what they could really do to you. Be honest, not hopeful. That's Machiavelli."),
('c5d',N,"On the right, write what your anger wants to do to them. That's Rumi's battlefield. Then... don't do it.","On the right, write what your anger wants to do to them. That's Rumi's battlefield. Then... don't do it."),
('c5e',N,"Instead, pick one move that makes you stronger. One rung... on the ladder they built for you.","Instead, pick one move that makes you stronger. One rung... on the ladder they built for you."),
('c5f',N,"Now tell me. Which is harder for you? Seeing an enemy clearly... or putting down the sword? Mind, or heart? Write it in the comments.","Now tell me. Which is harder for you? Seeing an enemy clearly... or putting down the sword? Mind, or heart? Write it in the comments."),
